DFOdDKwdpRmxVazDWlE.jpg"},{"id":45222,"name":"Joe Bugner","role":"Jack Ormond","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AqB1L0QuX2VlYxEDhukSupM9g0D.jpg"},{"id":56726,"name":"May Dlamini","role":"Mama Leone"},{"id":1289901,"name":"Dawn Jürgens","role":"Stella"},{"id":1289903,"name":"Ben Masinga","role":"Jason"},{"id":1289904,"name":"Les Marcowitz","role":"Trixie"},{"id":1497269,"name":"Sandy Nkomo","role":"Stella's Father"},{"id":1289902,"name":"Malcolm Kirk","role":"Ormond's Henchman"},{"id":1289905,"name":"Johan Naude","role":"Ormond's Henchman","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ntaU7S1zSPjIz3PIIttlUy73nlI.jpg"},{"id":224792,"name":"Mike Schutte","role":"Ormond's Henchman","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w7soiXfqJxzhya4NPIioN5uNh4w.jpg"},{"id":1289906,"name":"Kosie Smith","role":"Ormond's Henchman","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AkwVwIgkSrq1KX0OnzTWilocwRG.jpg"},{"id":1008488,"name":"Marcello Verziera","role":"Ormond's Henchman","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3CJe1JK12xaCtsRgk0zrJKQL7iH.jpg"},{"id":1163900,"name":"Nic van Rensburg"},{"id":1087390,"name":"Hugh Rouse","role":"Police Captain"},{"id":1289907,"name":"Joseph Szucs"},{"id":2223862,"name":"Tony  Binarelli","role":"Gambler (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sVHdgWXcQ2AcGEAyDplZPX4bYTY.jpg"},{"id":2437351,"name":"Derek Mills","role":"Man in Court (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/52jOgdu7iU7zOCxNcFoEojxOipO.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","overview":"Tom e Slim, due cugini che non si sopportano tra loro, il primo una guida di safari e il secondo uno scansafatiche, ma entrambi rispettosi dell'ambiente, entrano in conflitto con Jack Ormond, un locale trafficante di animali.","tagline":"Il safari è così bello!"},{"language":"en-US","title":"I'm for the Hippopotamus","overview":"In 1950, in Africa. Tom organizes safaris for tourists, secretly equipping them with guns loaded with blanks. When Slim, Tom’s cousin—a sly slacker and staunch environmentalist—arrives, the two men come into conflict with Jack Ormond, a local animal trafficker. A doctor, a friend of the duo, denounces Mr. Ormond’s exploitation of animals in a newspaper, prompting Ormond to send his henchmen to destroy the clinic where the good doctor practices. But at the medical facility, Ormond’s henchmen find Tom and Slim waiting for them, and in the blink of an eye, the two cousins wipe out these thugs in a brawl. Ormond then tries to bribe the two cousins, and when that fails, has them imprisoned for a theft they never committed. After escaping from prison, the two men rush toward Ormond’s ship, beating the merchant’s men to a pulp..."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tUwjJsL67AdnP6ST7ti43LcuJJP.svg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tUwjJsL67AdnP6ST7ti43LcuJJP.svg","language":"it","width":4958,"height":938},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9gXoPzxO0jsWvRtiP0fRF0xYHIt.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9gXoPzxO0jsWvRtiP0fRF0xYHIt.png","language":"it","width":4909,"height":898},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rPxnz7fy6GT00ITcpHjkVeEfFE8.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rPxnz7fy6GT00ITcpHjkVeEfFE8.png","language":"it","width":666,"height":375},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2gZ1rjb4kyCB1dWFIDqQZXDmyTM.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2gZ1rjb4kyCB1dWFIDqQZXDmyTM.png","language":"it","width":479,"height":200},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lLXvEdPSxnQ4fJebBeUWzPJDSAW.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lLXvEdPSxnQ4fJebBeUWzPJDSAW.png","language":"it","width":2400,"height":1000},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jjKVgsHxeSg83yIs6NnaYZ9j2L4.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.o